  "benefits": "**Financial Assistance:** Subsidy on 50% cost or ₹15,000/- for water carrying pipes upto 800m and all types of pipes(PVC HDPE etc.,) and all sizes as per the requirement of the farmer.\n",
  "brief_description": null,
